  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Airport Checkpoint Design RTM, through National US Arab Chamber Of Commerce (Inc)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This reverse trade mission (RTM) will support the travel of Indo-Pacific aviation security officials and airport representatives to attend the Transportation Security Administration (TSA) International Design Symposium in the United States (U.S.). The RTM will familiarize delegates with TSA airport checkpoint design requirements and best practices and introduce delegates to U.S. aviation security technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
